### 测试用户注册
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=lisi&password=***&nickname=李四

### 测试用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=lisi&password=***

### 发布文章
POST http://localhost:8080/api/articles/publish
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=我的第一篇文章&content=这是文章内容，Hello World！&userId=1

### 查询所有已发布文章
GET http://localhost:8080/api/articles

### 根据 ID 查询文章
GET http://localhost:8080/api/articles/1

### 查询某用户的文章
GET http://localhost:8080/api/articles/user/1

### 删除文章（软删除）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/articles/1?userId=1